sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Core as NestJS OpAMP Server
    participant Agent as Go OpAMP Client
    participant Config as Agent Configuration
    participant Run as Collector Runtime
    Admin->>Core: Publish targeted profile revision
    Agent->>Core: Authenticated OpAMP poll/status
    Core-->>Agent: RemoteConfig document + hash
    Agent->>Config: Schema/capability/revision validation + persist
    Config->>Run: Apply candidate if effective fingerprint changed
    alt Valid and ready
      Run-->>Agent: Generation applied
      Agent->>Core: remote_config_status APPLIED
    else Failure
      Run-->>Agent: LKG restored + error
      Agent->>Core: remote_config_status FAILED
    end
